Psalm 119:153-160

153 Sée my afflíction and delíver me,
for I do not forgét your láw.
154 Uphóld my cáuse and defénd me;
by your prómise, give me lífe.

155 Salvátion is fár from the wícked,
who are héedless of your státutes.
156 Númberless, LÓRD, are your mércies;
in your jústice, give me lífe.

157 Though my fóes and oppréssors are cóuntless,
I have not swérved from your decrées.
158 I lóok at the fáithless with disgúst;
they have not képt your wórd.

159 Sée how I lóve your précepts, O LÓRD!
In your mércy, give me lífe.
160 Trúth is the súm of your wórd;
all your just júdgments are etérnal.

Glóry to the Fáther, and to the Són,
and to the Hóly Spírit:
as it wás in the begínning, is nów,
and will be for éver. Amén.
